---
import InfoPage from '../layouts/InfoPage.astro';
---

<InfoPage title="Contact us" description="Get in touch with the Font Finder team." canonical="https://fontfinder.com/contact-us" eyebrow="Get in touch">
	<p class="text-lg leading-8 text-ink">Questions, feedback, or a font source you think we should know about? We’d love to hear from you.</p>
	<section class="rounded-2xl border border-hairline bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] text-ink">Send us a note</h2><p class="mt-3">Email <a class="font-medium text-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-link" href="mailto:hello@fontfinder.com">hello@fontfinder.com</a>. Please include a link or screenshot when your question relates to a specific font sample.</p></section>
	<section><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.04em] text-ink">What to include</h2><ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5"><li>What you were trying to identify or compare.</li><li>A clear screenshot or crop, if relevant.</li><li>Any details that may help us reproduce the issue or understand your feedback.</li></ul></section>
	<p class="border-t border-hairline pt-8 text-sm">We use contact messages to respond to your request and improve Font Finder. Please avoid sending sensitive personal information.</p>
</InfoPage>
